  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing Climate Change Loss and Damage - design, delivery and evaluation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment provides financial support for the design, delivery and evaluation of 4 Activities addressing loss and damage arising from climate change impacts in the Pacific. This will support implementation via 3 bilateral activities with Pacific partners and&#xa0;a Pacific regional activity that address loss and damage from the adverse impacts of climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
